<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria sells 2 bln levs 12-day discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria sells 2 bln levs 12-day discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed a special issue of 12-day discount T-bills worth two billion levs and yielding 6.84 percent to maturity, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial intitution or institutions the issue was placed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of issue follow. Price percent of par.</p>
<p>@</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3025597009</p>
<p> Type			    discount</p>
<p> Term			    12 days</p>
<p> Issue date		    April 2</p>
<p> Maturity date		 April 14</p>
<p> Par value		     2 bln levs</p>
<p> Selling price		 93.60 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     6.84 pct</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
